# Stripe architecture (pointer)

Full law: [`docs/docs/architecture/stripe.md`](../../docs/docs/architecture/stripe.md).

**Permanent decision:** credit packs buy in **HaloBand Mall** via Stripe.
**Payment Element** for card entry (no hosted Checkout / Portal as product
UI; React not required). Persist Stripe Customer + `pm_…` with brand/last4/exp
only. Player sets **default** card; **one card → auto-default**. Pack purchase
charges the default when set; otherwise Elements. Player wallet + purchase
history in Mall. Money → AC **only** via webhook + ledger
([Item Mall](../../docs/docs/architecture/item-mall.md)). Baseline may still
redirect — refactor toward this.

When changing checkout, saved cards, default PM, pack charge, wallet UI, or
webhook fulfill, read the full doc first. Also listed in `AGENTS.md`.
